  <diagram name="06 · ACTIVITY — LEARN MATERIAL" id="FgMAXvL673I__tg65tWS">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1948" dy="1014" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1840" pageHeight="2700" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\nskinparam preserveAspectRatio xMidYMid meet\nskinparam svgDimensionStyle false\nskinparam wrapWidth 180\n&lt;style&gt;\nActivityDiagram {\n  MaximumWidth 240\n}\n&lt;/style&gt;\nskinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam roundcorner 14\nskinparam defaultFontName SansSerif\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam ArrowColor #475569\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1.2\nskinparam TitleFontColor #0F172A\nskinparam TitleFontSize 22\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF7ED\nskinparam NoteBorderColor #F97316\nskinparam NoteFontColor #7C2D12\nskinparam activityBackgroundColor #EFF6FF\nskinparam activityBorderColor #2563EB\nskinparam activityFontColor #0F172A\nskinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7ED\nskinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #F97316\nskinparam activityStartColor #16A34A\nskinparam activityEndColor #DC2626\nskinparam partitionBackgroundColor #F8FAFC\nskinparam partitionBorderColor #CBD5E1\nskinparam partitionFontColor #334155\ntitle Activity — Browse Study Roadmap and Learn Material\n|Learner|\nstart\n:Open Study Roadmap or\nmaterial list;\n|Web App|\n:Load published roadmap and\nrecommended material order;\nnote right\n  Study Roadmap is an ordered\n  recommendation list only.\n  No prerequisite / progress lock.\nend note\n|Learner|\n:Browse categories and choose\nany available material;\n|Web App|\n:Request published material\ncontent;\n|Content Service|\n:Load material and published /\neffective content version;\nif (Published and effective?) then (yes)\n  :Check learner entitlement;\n  if (Entitled?) then (yes)\n    :Return structured contentJson\nand asset references;\n  else (no)\n    |Web App|\n    :Show access-tier locked state\nand upgrade CTA;\n    stop\n  endif\nelse (no)\n  :Return unavailable response;\n  stop\nendif\n|Firebase Storage|\n:Serve binary media referenced\nby assetId;\n|Web App|\n:Render typed content blocks and\nresume reading position;\n|Learner|\n:Read material;\nif (Bookmark or complete?) then (yes)\n  |Progress Service|\n  :Save bookmark, reading position,\nand completion idempotently;\n  |Database|\n  :Persist learning progress;\nendif\n|Web App|\n:Recommend next material or\npractice set;\nnote right\n  Recommendation never blocks\n  the learner from opening another\n  entitled published material.\nend note\nstop\n@enduml\n&quot;,&quot;config&quot;:null}" svgSizingMode="content-driven-auto-fit" svgAspectPolicy="root-preserveAspectRatio-xMidYMid-meet" svgContentWidth="1100" svgContentHeight="1600" svgDisplayMode="infinite-canvas" svgUniformScale="1.6" recommendedZoomMode="100%-or-fit-width" sourceWidthPolicy="activity-wrap-30" fontPolicy="SansSerif-portable" renderPolicy="plantuml-svg-root-aspect-safe" svgDimensionPolicy="viewBox-only-no-fixed-width-height" id="g-06-6aef94c6b7">
